OL,3,AMandelson kept lobby firm shares for
OL,4,Amonths as ambassador, despite conflict
OL,5,Aof interest fears
OL,6,
OL,7,FLord Mandelson kept shares in a lobby
OL,8,Ffirm for months while US ambassador as
OL,9,Fhe felt he hadn't been made a fair
OL,10,Foffer, newly released documents show
OL,12,FMandelson became the UK ambassador to
OL,13,Fthe US in February 2025. In a letter, a
OL,14,Fmonth later, the head of the Foreign
OL,15,FOffice is seen to say "the ideal" would
OL,16,Fhave been for Mandelson to sell his
OL,17,Fshares - there's more on that letter
OL,18,Fhere
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
